.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG6l3pv6EokW4d3pW-w8jtcEMXT0piiOR9CjZN4A4g3FmrJFgR7mQdD48xtX2QLrZ60YdUn8cqCnlcNORJ2R-k5Zm56zKc15sTujNiZg2XUUFBQLMA0)","truncated_fields":["content"]}
